{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23905","headline":"从龙潭寺至少林寺题赠同游者 · 白居易","name":"从龙潭寺至少林寺题赠同游者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山屐田衣六七贤，搴芳蹋翠弄潺湲。\n九龙潭月落桮酒，三品松风飘管弦。\n强健且宜游胜地，清凉不觉过炎天。\n始知驾鹤乘云外，别有逍遥地上仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}